          {
            "type": 12,
            "content": {
              "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
              "groupType": "editable",
              "exportParameters": false,
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": 1,
                  "name": "Serverless inventory and known-total guidance",
                  "content": {
                    "style": "info",
                    "json": "**Included in CSPM and known totals.** Azure apps/functions and available running ACI containers are discovered automatically. Inventory is a full-month projection, not a measured monthly average or proof that Defender coverage is enabled. ACA replica counts and AWS Lambda/ECS runtime quantities are not guessed; use the optional numeric forecasts when needed. Each forecast applies separately to every selected Azure subscription or distinct AWS connector scope. Blank is automatic/unknown, not zero. Selected inputs without a reliable quantity stay unpriced and are counted in the visible estimate status. Snapshot: **{serverlessInventory:$.capturedAt}**. Refresh the workbook to refresh discovery. Resource details show up to 1,000 rows; the scope-cost snapshot aggregates the matching inventory before that display limit."
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": 3,
                  "content": {
                    "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
                    "query": "resourcecontainers\r\n| where type =~ \"microsoft.resources/subscriptions\" and tolower(\"{azureIsDcspm}\") == \"true\"\r\n| project Cloud = \"Azure\", ScopeId = tolower(subscriptionId), ScopeName = name, ResourceId = strcat(\"/subscriptions/\", subscriptionId)\r\n| union (\r\nresources\r\n| where type =~ \"microsoft.security/securityconnectors\" and tostring(properties.environmentName) =~ \"aws\" and tolower(\"{awsIsDcspm}\") == \"true\"\r\n| where tolower('{AWSSecurityConnectors}') has tolower(id)\r\n| project Cloud = \"AWS\", ScopeId = tolower(id), ScopeName = name, ResourceId = id\r\n)\r\n| extend SLRoot = parse_json(\"{serverlessInventory:escapejson}\")\r\n| extend SLData = SLRoot.d[ScopeId]\r\n| where Cloud == \"Azure\" or not(coalesce(tolong(SLRoot._ok) == 1 and array_length(SLData) == 5 and tolong(SLData[4]) == 0, false))\r\n| extend Parts = dynamic([\"protection\", \"containers\"])\r\n| mv-expand Parts\r\n| extend Component = tostring(Parts)\r\n| where (Component == \"protection\" and tolong(\"{serverlessProtection}\") == 1) or (Component == \"containers\" and tolong(\"{serverlessContainers}\") == 1)\r\n| extend OverrideText = case(Cloud == \"Azure\" and Component == \"protection\", \"{azureServerlessProtectionAverage:escapejson}\", Cloud == \"Azure\", \"{azureServerlessContainersAverage:escapejson}\", Component == \"protection\", \"{awsServerlessProtectionAverage:escapejson}\", \"{awsServerlessContainersAverage:escapejson}\")\r\n| extend Override = todouble(OverrideText), Provided = isnotempty(OverrideText)\r\n| extend OverrideValid = isfinite(Override) and Override >= 0.0 and Override < 1000000000000.0 and OverrideText matches regex @\"^(0|[1-9][0-9]*)(\\.[0-9]+)?$\"\r\n| extend EntryValid = tolong(SLRoot._ok) == 1 and gettype(SLRoot.d) == \"dictionary\" and iff(Cloud == \"Azure\", isnull(SLData) or array_length(SLData) == 5, isnotnull(SLData) and array_length(SLData) == 5 and tolong(SLData[4]) in (0,1))\r\n| extend AutoQuantity = iff(isnull(SLData), 0.0, iff(Component == \"protection\", todouble(SLData[0]), todouble(SLData[1]))), AutoMissing = iff(isnull(SLData), 0, iff(Component == \"protection\", tolong(SLData[2]), tolong(SLData[3])))\r\n| extend AutoValid = EntryValid and isfinite(AutoQuantity) and AutoQuantity >= 0.0 and isnotnull(AutoMissing) and AutoMissing >= 0\r\n| extend KnownQuantity = iff(Cloud == \"AWS\" and not(EntryValid), 0.0, iff(Provided, iff(OverrideValid, Override, 0.0), iff(Cloud == \"Azure\" and AutoValid, AutoQuantity, 0.0)))\r\n| extend UnpricedInputs = iff(Cloud == \"AWS\" and not(EntryValid), 1, iff(Provided, iff(OverrideValid, 0, 1), iff(Cloud == \"Azure\" and AutoValid, AutoMissing, 1)))\r\n| extend Basis = iff(Cloud == \"AWS\" and not(EntryValid), \"Connector identity snapshot unavailable\", iff(Provided, iff(OverrideValid, \"Per-scope monthly-average forecast\", \"Invalid forecast override\"), iff(Cloud == \"Azure\", \"Current inventory projection\", \"Forecast needed: AWS telemetry unavailable\")))\r\n| extend ResourcesPerUnit = iff(Component == \"protection\", 8.0, 2.0)\r\n| extend BillableUnits = KnownQuantity / ResourcesPerUnit, KnownMonthlyCost = KnownQuantity / ResourcesPerUnit * todouble({retailPricing:$.monthly.cspm}) * {discountToMultiplyVal}\r\n| summarize KnownQuantity = sum(KnownQuantity), BillableUnits = sum(BillableUnits), KnownMonthlyCost = sum(KnownMonthlyCost), UnpricedInputs = sum(UnpricedInputs) by Cloud, Component\r\n| extend Component = iff(Component == \"protection\", \"Serverless protection\", \"Serverless containers\")\r\n| extend Status = iff(UnpricedInputs == 0, \"Known inputs priced; included in totals\", strcat(\"Partial: \", UnpricedInputs, \" unpriced inputs; enter forecasts below\"))\r\n| project Cloud, Component, KnownQuantity, BillableUnits, KnownMonthlyCost = iff(UnpricedInputs > 0 and KnownQuantity == 0.0, real(null), KnownMonthlyCost), Status",
                    "size": 0,
                    "title": "Serverless CSPM portion (included in known totals)",
                    "queryType": 1,
                    "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
                    "crossComponentResources": [
                      "{Subscriptions}"
                    ],
                    "showExportToExcel": true,
                    "exportToExcelOptions": "all",
                    "gridSettings": {
                      "rowLimit": 4,
                      "filter": false,
                      "formatters": [
                        {
                          "columnMatch": "KnownMonthlyCost",
                          "formatter": 18,
                          "formatOptions": {
                            "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                            "thresholdsGrid": [
                              {
                                "operator": "is Empty",
                                "representation": "Blank",
                                "text": "Not estimated"
                              },
                              {
                                "operator": "Default",
                                "thresholdValue": null,
                                "representation": "Blank",
                                "text": "{0}"
                              }
                            ]
                          },
                          "numberFormat": {
                            "unit": 0,
                            "options": {
                              "currency": "USD",
                              "style": "currency",
                              "minimumFractionDigits": 2,
                              "maximumFractionDigits": 2
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      ],
                      "labelSettings": [
                        {
                          "columnId": "Cloud",
                          "label": "Cloud"
                        },
                        {
                          "columnId": "Component",
                          "label": "Component"
                        },
                        {
                          "columnId": "KnownQuantity",
                          "label": "Known quantity / forecast"
                        },
                        {
                          "columnId": "BillableUnits",
                          "label": "Known billable units"
                        },
                        {
                          "columnId": "KnownMonthlyCost",
                          "label": "Included monthly cost (USD)"
                        },
                        {
                          "columnId": "Status",
                          "label": "Estimate status"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "noDataMessage": "No selected serverless scopes were found in the readable inventory.",
                    "sortBy": []
                  },
                  "name": "Serverless CSPM summary"
                },
                {
                  "type": 9,
                  "content": {
                    "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                    "style": "above",
                    "parameters": [
                      {
                        "id": "71dc3d71-518a-45b0-98b2-7dc99e58c285",
                        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                        "name": "showServerlessResourceDetails",
                        "label": "Resource details",
                        "type": 10,
                        "isRequired": true,
                        "value": "0",
                        "typeSettings": {
                          "additionalResourceOptions": [],
                          "showDefault": false
                        },
                        "jsonData": "[{\"value\":\"0\",\"label\":\"Hide\",\"selected\":true},{\"value\":\"1\",\"label\":\"Show\"}]"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "name": "Serverless resource detail options"
                },
                {
                  "type": 3,
                  "content": {
                    "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
                    "query": "resources\r\n| where tolower(\"{azureIsDcspm}\") == \"true\" and (tolong(\"{serverlessProtection}\") == 1 or tolong(\"{serverlessContainers}\") == 1)\r\n| where type in~ (\"microsoft.web/sites\", \"microsoft.app/containerapps\", \"microsoft.containerinstance/containergroups\")\r\n| extend ResourceType = tolower(type), ScopeId = tolower(subscriptionId), ResourceId = id, ResourceName = name, ResourceKind = tolower(iff(isnotempty(kind), kind, tostring(properties.kind)))\r\n| extend Component = iff(ResourceType == \"microsoft.web/sites\", \"protection\", \"containers\")\r\n| where (Component == \"protection\" and tolong(\"{serverlessProtection}\") == 1) or (Component == \"containers\" and tolong(\"{serverlessContainers}\") == 1)\r\n| extend IsSite = ResourceType == \"microsoft.web/sites\", IsACI = ResourceType == \"microsoft.containerinstance/containergroups\"\r\n| extend SiteRecognized = IsSite and (ResourceKind has \"functionapp\" or ResourceKind has \"app\") and ResourceKind !has \"workflowapp\"\r\n| extend InventoryContainers = iff(IsACI and isnotnull(properties.containers) and array_length(properties.containers) > 0, properties.containers, dynamic([{}]))\r\n| mv-expand InventoryContainer = InventoryContainers limit 2000\r\n| extend ContainerState = tolower(tostring(InventoryContainer.properties.instanceView.currentState.state))\r\n| extend ResourceState = iff(IsSite, tostring(properties.state), iff(IsACI, ContainerState, tostring(properties.runningStatus)))\r\n| extend KnownQuantity = case(SiteRecognized, 1.0, IsACI and ContainerState == \"running\", 1.0, 0.0)\r\n| extend UnpricedInputs = case(IsSite and not(SiteRecognized), 1, IsACI and isempty(ContainerState), 1, ResourceType == \"microsoft.app/containerapps\", 1, 0)\r\n| extend Workload = case(SiteRecognized and ResourceKind has \"functionapp\", \"Azure Function App\", SiteRecognized, \"Azure Web App\", IsSite, \"Unclassified App Service site\", IsACI, \"ACI container\", \"Azure Container App\")\r\n| extend ResourceName = iff(IsACI and isnotempty(tostring(InventoryContainer.name)), strcat(ResourceName, \" / \", tostring(InventoryContainer.name)), ResourceName)\r\n| project Cloud = \"Azure\", ScopeId, ResourceId, ResourceName, ResourceType, ResourceState, Component, Workload, KnownQuantity, UnpricedInputs\r\n| extend SLRoot = parse_json(\"{serverlessInventory:escapejson}\"), OverrideText = iff(Component == \"protection\", \"{azureServerlessProtectionAverage:escapejson}\", \"{azureServerlessContainersAverage:escapejson}\")\r\n| where isempty(OverrideText)\r\n| extend ScopeName = ScopeId\r\n| join kind=leftouter (\r\nresourcecontainers\r\n| where type =~ \"microsoft.resources/subscriptions\"\r\n| project ScopeId = tolower(subscriptionId), SubscriptionName = name\r\n) on ScopeId\r\n| extend ScopeName = iff(isnotempty(SubscriptionName), SubscriptionName, ScopeName)\r\n| extend Quantity = iff(UnpricedInputs > 0, real(null), KnownQuantity), Basis = \"Current resource inventory\"\r\n| extend Status = case(UnpricedInputs > 0 and ResourceType == \"microsoft.app/containerapps\", \"Runtime replica count unavailable; use the per-subscription forecast\", UnpricedInputs > 0, \"Runtime/type information unavailable; use a forecast\", \"Inventory snapshot; not a measured monthly average\")\r\n| project Cloud, ScopeName, ResourceName, Workload, ResourceType, ResourceState, Component, Quantity, Basis, Status, ResourceId\r\n| union (\r\nresourcecontainers\r\n| where type =~ \"microsoft.resources/subscriptions\" and tolower(\"{azureIsDcspm}\") == \"true\"\r\n| project Cloud = \"Azure\", ScopeId = tolower(subscriptionId), ScopeName = name, ResourceId = strcat(\"/subscriptions/\", subscriptionId)\r\n| union (\r\nresources\r\n| where type =~ \"microsoft.security/securityconnectors\" and tostring(properties.environmentName) =~ \"aws\" and tolower(\"{awsIsDcspm}\") == \"true\"\r\n| where tolower('{AWSSecurityConnectors}') has tolower(id)\r\n| project Cloud = \"AWS\", ScopeId = tolower(id), ScopeName = name, ResourceId = id\r\n)\r\n| extend SLRoot = parse_json(\"{serverlessInventory:escapejson}\")\r\n| extend SLData = SLRoot.d[ScopeId]\r\n| where Cloud == \"Azure\" or not(coalesce(tolong(SLRoot._ok) == 1 and array_length(SLData) == 5 and tolong(SLData[4]) == 0, false))\r\n| extend Parts = dynamic([\"protection\", \"containers\"])\r\n| mv-expand Parts\r\n| extend Component = tostring(Parts)\r\n| where (Component == \"protection\" and tolong(\"{serverlessProtection}\") == 1) or (Component == \"containers\" and tolong(\"{serverlessContainers}\") == 1)\r\n| extend OverrideText = case(Cloud == \"Azure\" and Component == \"protection\", \"{azureServerlessProtectionAverage:escapejson}\", Cloud == \"Azure\", \"{azureServerlessContainersAverage:escapejson}\", Component == \"protection\", \"{awsServerlessProtectionAverage:escapejson}\", \"{awsServerlessContainersAverage:escapejson}\")\r\n| extend Override = todouble(OverrideText), Provided = isnotempty(OverrideText)\r\n| extend OverrideValid = isfinite(Override) and Override >= 0.0 and Override < 1000000000000.0 and OverrideText matches regex @\"^(0|[1-9][0-9]*)(\\.[0-9]+)?$\"\r\n| extend EntryValid = tolong(SLRoot._ok) == 1 and gettype(SLRoot.d) == \"dictionary\" and iff(Cloud == \"Azure\", isnull(SLData) or array_length(SLData) == 5, isnotnull(SLData) and array_length(SLData) == 5 and tolong(SLData[4]) in (0,1))\r\n| extend AutoQuantity = iff(isnull(SLData), 0.0, iff(Component == \"protection\", todouble(SLData[0]), todouble(SLData[1]))), AutoMissing = iff(isnull(SLData), 0, iff(Component == \"protection\", tolong(SLData[2]), tolong(SLData[3])))\r\n| extend AutoValid = EntryValid and isfinite(AutoQuantity) and AutoQuantity >= 0.0 and isnotnull(AutoMissing) and AutoMissing >= 0\r\n| extend KnownQuantity = iff(Cloud == \"AWS\" and not(EntryValid), 0.0, iff(Provided, iff(OverrideValid, Override, 0.0), iff(Cloud == \"Azure\" and AutoValid, AutoQuantity, 0.0)))\r\n| extend UnpricedInputs = iff(Cloud == \"AWS\" and not(EntryValid), 1, iff(Provided, iff(OverrideValid, 0, 1), iff(Cloud == \"Azure\" and AutoValid, AutoMissing, 1)))\r\n| extend Basis = iff(Cloud == \"AWS\" and not(EntryValid), \"Connector identity snapshot unavailable\", iff(Provided, iff(OverrideValid, \"Per-scope monthly-average forecast\", \"Invalid forecast override\"), iff(Cloud == \"Azure\", \"Current inventory projection\", \"Forecast needed: AWS telemetry unavailable\")))\r\n| extend ResourcesPerUnit = iff(Component == \"protection\", 8.0, 2.0)\r\n| extend BillableUnits = KnownQuantity / ResourcesPerUnit, KnownMonthlyCost = KnownQuantity / ResourcesPerUnit * todouble({retailPricing:$.monthly.cspm}) * {discountToMultiplyVal}\r\n| where Provided or Cloud == \"AWS\"\r\n| extend ResourceName = iff(Provided, \"Per-scope forecast override\", \"Runtime/inventory quantity unavailable\"), ResourceType = iff(Cloud == \"Azure\", \"Azure subscription forecast\", \"AWS connector forecast\"), ResourceState = \"\"\r\n| extend Workload = iff(Component == \"containers\", \"Running containers forecast\", iff(Cloud == \"Azure\", \"Apps/functions forecast\", \"Lambda functions forecast\"))\r\n| extend Quantity = iff(UnpricedInputs > 0, real(null), KnownQuantity), Status = iff(UnpricedInputs == 0, \"Forecast replaces inventory for this scope; included in totals\", \"Refresh the snapshot, enter a valid per-scope average, or exclude\")\r\n| project Cloud, ScopeName, ResourceName, Workload, ResourceType, ResourceState, Component, Quantity, Basis, Status, ResourceId\r\n)\r\n| extend Component = iff(Component == \"protection\", \"Serverless protection\", \"Serverless containers\")\r\n| order by Cloud asc, ScopeName asc, Component asc, ResourceName asc",
                    "size": 0,
                    "title": "Discovered resources and per-scope forecast inputs",
                    "queryType": 1,
                    "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
                    "crossComponentResources": [
                      "{Subscriptions}"
                    ],
                    "showExportToExcel": true,
                    "exportToExcelOptions": "all",
                    "gridSettings": {
                      "rowLimit": 1000,
                      "filter": true,
                      "formatters": [
                        {
                          "columnMatch": "ResourceId",
                          "formatter": 5
                        },
                        {
                          "columnMatch": "ResourceType",
                          "formatter": 5
                        },
                        {
                          "columnMatch": "Quantity",
                          "formatter": 18,
                          "formatOptions": {
                            "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                            "thresholdsGrid": [
                              {
                                "operator": "is Empty",
                                "representation": "Blank",
                                "text": "Unavailable"
                              },
                              {
                                "operator": "Default",
                                "thresholdValue": null,
                                "representation": "Blank",
                                "text": "{0}"
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ],
                      "labelSettings": [
                        {
                          "columnId": "Cloud",
                          "label": "Cloud"
                        },
                        {
                          "columnId": "ScopeName",
                          "label": "Subscription / connector"
                        },
                        {
                          "columnId": "ResourceName",
                          "label": "Resource / forecast"
                        },
                        {
                          "columnId": "Workload",
                          "label": "Workload"
                        },
                        {
                          "columnId": "ResourceType",
                          "label": "Resource type"
                        },
                        {
                          "columnId": "ResourceState",
                          "label": "State"
                        },
                        {
                          "columnId": "Component",
                          "label": "Component"
                        },
                        {
                          "columnId": "Quantity",
                          "label": "Known quantity / average"
                        },
                        {
                          "columnId": "Basis",
                          "label": "Data source"
                        },
                        {
                          "columnId": "Status",
                          "label": "Status"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "noDataMessage": "No matching discovered resources or forecast overrides. Automatic zero means no matching Azure resources in the readable snapshot, not a measured monthly average.",
                    "sortBy": []
                  },
                  "name": "Serverless CSPM resource estimates",
                  "conditionalVisibility": {
                    "parameterName": "showServerlessResourceDetails",
                    "comparison": "isEqualTo",
                    "value": "1"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            "conditionalVisibility": {
              "parameterName": "serverlessComponentsIncluded",
              "comparison": "isEqualTo",
              "value": "1"
            },
            "name": "Optional serverless CSPM estimates"
          }
        ]
      },
      "name": "subscriptionGroup"
    },
    {
      "type": 12,
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 9,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
              "parameters": [
                {
                  "id": "7e75b4e4-c8c8-4800-98da-edef70c49ccb",
                  "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                  "name": "azureTenantPlans",
                  "label": "Azure - Microsoft Defender for Cloud plans",
                  "type": 2,
                  "description": "Please select one or several Azure plans to allow the workbook to calculate Defender for Cloud cost.",
                  "multiSelect": true,
                  "quote": "",
                  "delimiter": ",",
                  "typeSettings": {
                    "additionalResourceOptions": [
                      "value::all"
                    ],
                    "showDefault": false
                  },
                  "jsonData": "[\r\n{ \"value\": \"microsoft.compute/virtualmachines, microsoft.compute/virtualmachinescalesets, microsoft.hybridcompute/machines, microsoft.classiccompute/virtualmachines\", \"label\": \"Microsoft Defender for Servers\"},\r\n { \"value\": \"microsoft.web/serverfarms\", \"label\": \"Microsoft Defender for App Service\"},\r\n { \"value\": \"microsoft.sql/servers, microsoft.sql/managedinstances\", \"label\": \"Microsoft Defender for SQL on Azure-connected databases\"},\r\n {\"value\": \"microsoft.dbforpostgresql/servers, microsoft.dbforpostgresql/flexibleservers, microsoft.dbformysql/servers, microsoft.dbformysql/flexibleservers, microsoft.dbformariadb/servers\", \"label\": \"Microsoft Defender for MySQL / Microsoft Defender for PostgreSQL\"},\r\n { \"value\": \"microsoft.containerservice/managedclusters\", \"label\": \"Microsoft Defender for Containers\"},\r\n { \"value\": \"microsoft.storage/storageaccounts - storageenabled\", \"label\": \"Microsoft Defender for Storage\"},\r\n { \"value\": \"microsoft.compute/virtualmachines, microsoft.classiccompute/virtualmachines, microsoft.compute/virtualmachinescalesets, microsoft.sql/servers, microsoft.hybridcompute/machines, microsoft.dbforpostgresql/servers, microsoft.dbformysql/servers, microsoft.dbforpostgresql/flexibleservers, microsoft.dbformysql/flexibleservers, microsoft.sql/managedinstances, microsoft.dbformariadb/servers, Microsoft.synapse/workspaces, microsoft.storage/storageaccounts\", \"label\": \"Microsoft Defender CSPM\"},\r\n {\"value\": \"microsoft.resources/subscriptions\", \"label\": \"Microsoft Defender for Resource Manager\"},\r\n {\"value\": \"microsoft.keyvault/vaults\", \"label\": \"Microsoft Defender for Key Vault\"},\r\n {\"value\": \"microsoft.apimanagement/service\", \"label\": \"Microsoft Defender for APIs\"}\r\n]",
                  "timeContext": {
                    "durationMs": 86400000
                  },
                  "value": [
                    "value::all"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                  "name": "awsTenantPlans",
                  "label": "AWS - Microsoft Defender for Cloud plans",
                  "type": 2,
                  "description": "Please select one or several AWS plans to allow the workbook to calculate Defender for Cloud cost.",
                  "multiSelect": true,
                  "quote": "",
                  "delimiter": ",",
                  "typeSettings": {
                    "additionalResourceOptions": [
                      "value::all"
                    ],
                    "showDefault": false
                  },
                  "jsonData": "[\r\n{ \"value\": \"Microsoft.Security/securityConnectors/EC2instance\", \"label\": \"Microsoft Defender for Servers\"},\r\n  { \"value\": \"Microsoft.Security/securityConnectors/EC2instance, Microsoft.Security/securityConnectors/S3Bucket, Microsoft.Security/securityConnectors/RDSdb\", \"label\": \"Microsoft Defender CSPM\"}\r\n]",
                  "timeContext": {
                    "durationMs": 86400000
                  },
                  "value": [
                    "value::all"
                  ],
                  "id": "9d6c24c8-eadf-4db7-bb4d-0fcee9fb99ee"
                },
                {
                  "id": "eb8783f4-3610-4da2-8410-0f8847175a12",
                  "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                  "name": "gcpTenantPlans",
                  "label": "GCP - Microsoft Defender for Cloud plans",
                  "type": 2,
                  "description": "Please select one or several GCP plans to allow the workbook to calculate Defender for Cloud cost.",
                  "multiSelect": true,
                  "quote": "",
                  "delimiter": ",",
                  "typeSettings": {
                    "additionalResourceOptions": [
                      "value::all"
                    ],
                    "showDefault": false
                  },
                  "jsonData": "[\r\n    { \"value\": \"microsoft.security/securityconnectors/computeinstances\", \"label\": \"Microsoft Defender for Servers\"},\r\n  { \"value\": \"microsoft.security/securityconnectors/computeinstances, microsoft.security/securityconnectors/storagebuckets, microsoft.security/securityconnectors/sqladmininstances\", \"label\": \"Microsoft Defender CSPM\"}\r\n]\r\n",
                  "timeContext": {
                    "durationMs": 86400000
                  },
                  "value": [
                    "value::all"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "56dd02c1-e73c-4fc4-a480-1d93165297f8",
                  "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                  "name": "tenantInfo",
                  "label": "Additional information",
                  "type": 10,
                  "isRequired": true,
                  "typeSettings": {
                    "additionalResourceOptions": [],
                    "showDefault": false
                  },
                  "jsonData": "[\r\n { \"value\": 1, \"label\": \"On\", \"selected\": true},\r\n { \"value\": 0, \"label\": \"Off\"}\r\n]"
                },
                {
                  "id": "70a8a248-e441-4601-a0cc-2484930eda44",
                  "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                  "name": "tenantInfoRes",
                  "type": 1,
                  "isHiddenWhenLocked": true,
                  "criteriaData": [
                    {
                      "criteriaContext": {
                        "operator": "Default",
                        "resultValType": "expression",
                        "resultVal": "{tenantInfo}"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "style": "above",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
            },
            "conditionalVisibility": {
              "parameterName": "istenantlevel",
              "comparison": "isEqualTo",
              "value": "1"
            },
            "name": "Plan Picker"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "* ###### The costs displayed are estimated and might be different from the actual costs seen in the invoice.  \r\n\r\n* ###### The estimated costs displayed are monthly estimated costs per subscription and/or AWS account and/or GCP project based on currently active resources.\r\n\r\n* ###### To estimate the costs for a subscription and/or AWS account and/or GCP project, you need Azure RBAC Reader access to each included subscription. Microsoft Entra Global Administrator does not automatically grant Azure subscription access; only resources in your readable scope can be estimated. \r\n\r\n* ###### This workbook displays the cost for Defender for Storage in Azure based on a per-storage account calculation, but accounts with an exceptionally high transaction volume incur an overage charge that won’t be seen in this workbook. For more information on Defender for Storage cost estimation calculations, please visit our [GitHub page](https://github.com/Azure/Microsoft-Defender-for-Cloud/tree/main/Workbooks/Microsoft%20Defender%20for%20Storage%20Price%20Estimation).\r\n\r\n* ###### Defender for Cosmos DB plan in Azure currently can’t be estimated, we are working to include it in the future.\r\n\r\n* ###### The cost estimation is based on the retail prices of Defender plans; Learn more about [Defender plans’ retail price](https://azure.microsoft.com/pricing/details/defender-for-cloud/).\r\n\r\n* ###### Microsoft Defender CSPM protects across all your multicloud workloads, with base billing for Servers, Databases and Storages at ${retailPricing:$.monthly.cspm}/billable resource/month. Please visit [Defender CSPM documentation page](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/defender-for-cloud/concept-cloud-security-posture-management) for more information.\r\n\r\n* ###### **Serverless protection:** Include adds known apps/functions divided by eight to CSPM billable units and adds their discounted cost to scope, cloud, and overall known totals. Azure app inventory is discovered automatically; AWS Lambda uses an explicit numeric forecast when inventory is unavailable. Optional averages replace discovery per selected scope.\r\n\r\n* ###### **Serverless containers:** Include adds known running containers divided by two to CSPM billable units and known totals. Available ACI runtime states are read automatically; ACA/ECS replica quantities are not guessed. Use the visible numeric per-scope forecasts when needed. Unknown quantities stay unpriced and are flagged, not treated as a complete zero.\r\n\r\n* ###### Defender CSPM plan in GCP cost estimation counts all storage buckets, although in reality only buckets from class ‘standard’ will be charged. In addition, the charge for this plan will apply only for buckets from the following regions: \r\n###### europe-west1, us-east1, us-west1, us-central1, us-east4, asia-south1, northamerica-northeast1.\r\n\r\n* ###### Defender CSPM plan in GCP cost estimation may not count all Google Instance Group instances, although they are going to be charged as well.\r\n\r\n* ###### Defender for APIs uses one selected entitlement plan per subscription. The full selected monthly base fee is estimated once for each included subscription, before the manual discount; API Management service count, API count, and lower traffic do not prorate it or blend multiple plans. Traffic above the selected entitlement incurs separate overages, not an automatic plan upgrade. This workbook does not retrieve monthly traffic or include overages, so its displayed base fee is not a complete bill when an entitlement is exceeded. [Plan and overage guidance](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/defender-for-cloud/defender-for-apis-deploy#enable-the-defender-for-apis-plan). For traffic-based estimation, see the [Defender APIs Cost Estimator](https://github.com/Azure/Microsoft-Defender-for-Cloud/tree/main/Powershell%20scripts/Defender%20APIs%20Cost%20Estimator).\r\n\r\n* ###### AWS account and GCP project rows are keyed by Azure security-connector resource IDs, not native AWS account numbers or GCP project IDs. The subscription segment identifies the Azure hosting scope.\r\n\r\n* ###### Exported count columns are quantities, not costs. `ContainersInRg` is Kubernetes VM vCores, not serverless containers. Original count fields remain base-inventory counts; `CspmBillableUnits` includes known selected serverless units. Resource snapshots are full-month projections, not measured monthly averages. CSPM retains its own count under the existing AKS exclusion logic.",
              "style": "info"
            },
            "customWidth": "50",
            "conditionalVisibilities": [
              {
                "parameterName": "istenantlevel",
                "comparison": "isEqualTo",
                "value": "1"
              },
              {
                "parameterName": "tenantInfoRes",
                "comparison": "isEqualTo",
                "value": "1"
              }
            ],
            "name": "text - 6 - Copy"
          },
          {
            "type": 9,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
              "parameters": [
                {
                  "id": "af54d179-7a17-4c2d-a2c8-b8fe9e6f5ab2",
